                  <nc xml:id="m-5fdc9d64-8850-4b58-988f-ffc4e3b31766" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-e6058b11-8677-4870-9e39-90d75701d008"><lg xml:id="m-adaac9d5-8aa9-4b4e-8f3f-399959a9f4ed"><l xml:id="m-8a253e4d-5dc3-4569-b176-57a83c281cb5" facs="#m-6196ea4b-6a40-4a69-8c3e-81f766845e84" label="text-like">Proper feasts of U. S. A.</l><l xml:id="m-56923143-0efc-47ca-98a5-4eddbf518524" facs="#m-461d4ea1-6b85-428f-a173-ca6e93270dbb" label="ambiguous">(26)</l><l xml:id="m-5fae05ac-b388-42d9-8307-c5a19caaf2f6" facs="#m-59d3cea4-c595-493f-8899-d15ad96b7f3d" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-26009822-af01-48d4-940d-c91265afedee" facs="#m-94c9e5ca-0345-49da-b901-9eb6197f2390" label="lyrics-like">IIT nobis, Dómine, reparátio sancto Isidóro Confessóre tuo,</l><l xml:id="m-7baf204c-854a-4985-b8ef-22fe472fe382" facs="#m-567b5897-ec9e-4eec-8e83-d5581d0e7619" label="lyrics-like">O mentis et córporis caeléste sentiámus efféctum. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b82025bc-4c68-4cbd-93b5-4d98a48c8e66" facs="#m-376e61ca-d0b1-47c0-a433-3f1522f0359b" label="lyrics-like">mystérium: et praesta; ut cujus num nostrum Jesum Christum</l><l xml:id="m-26a21f57-f821-4b9c-a82b-95e71e879c7c" facs="#m-01fffb7e-ae1c-4e8b-97ed-61f927c8d96d" label="lyrics-like">exséquimur cultum, intercedénte Filium tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-2a73522b-422a-4d87-8d42-ad4bb356a4d9" facs="#m-fd6a30ad-e2ad-4c1d-bda6-974ec9d0a7a2" label="text-like">AT VESPERS</l><l xml:id="m-aa38751a-603b-4e58-966e-15bda49cda7e" facs="#m-2ba995ff-e766-4a73-b204-300e6a5e8a10" label="text-like">Ants. and pss. of the day occurring, pp. 280f, chapter, hymn and</l><l xml:id="m-6fdc75ea-dc1b-443c-8068-e91822d2bc97" facs="#m-7f0d4255-9aa4-4b22-8198-8619f40e4990" label="text-like">V. from the Common, p. 1196.</l><l xml:id="m-bdbf7a8f-bc38-43ff-96b9-19c691b11fad" facs="#m-dbb3be73-48c3-4e01-8213-ba07e7a94514" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-0ae03ed6-eec1-4af1-9394-a53b4b4080ab" facs="#m-a710bea3-332b-4189-991c-404251c2ea33" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.1</l><l xml:id="m-2b50a312-cc53-4900-b1c2-56d3ebff61e8" facs="#m-aa85ebbc-a491-4964-989b-1a5c4a46efb7" label="lyrics-like">CA Cce hómo “agrí-co-la iste fú-it, quóni-am</l><l xml:id="m-c555d545-c49e-4ced-9a75-c2281733cdfe" facs="#m-fc4699c1-d97c-4208-9d50-4e760ac64c03" label="lyrics-like">Adam exémplum é-jus ab ado-lescénti-a sú¬a</l><l xml:id="m-b84c7830-8b50-4187-9937-c74ec0558aa6" facs="#m-693167f3-6ffa-46e1-8a34-87447b874cff" label="ambiguous">ad</l><l xml:id="m-d64a39a6-3d20-4406-b92b-e8116d5bc325" facs="#m-9fc92b4c-a003-400a-828c-c729eaa04ff7" label="lyrics-like">servi- éndum Dé-o vivén-ti. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-2c2b33e8-c2fc-4baf-93dc-de17251cb816" facs="#m-09871357-c305-4621-b3bc-297d9d2aa306" label="text-like">Prayer. Da nobis. (25).</l><l xml:id="m-0e8b59b2-7b33-4ca3-bd7d-3c9da6f0fc57" facs="#m-66f3cc1e-bee3-47ff-821a-c2fda36c1e79" label="text-like">APRIL 5 (or 6)</l><l xml:id="m-23e21558-478e-479f-9220-e46d2fa32ed5" facs="#m-740c1804-0611-4944-ac7e-98d92bd26184" label="text-like">Bd. Juliana of Cornillon, Virgin I elass</l><l xml:id="m-051cb0f9-c86a-45d2-a064-d2f50d9183a7" facs="#m-b84ee49c-6591-4c1a-a0b1-0b0c2211f547" label="text-like">In the diocese of Portland</l><l xml:id="m-4577bd9f-a461-428f-b5b0-822f492ec4c2" facs="#m-5c569382-f016-4868-96b7-d41c6470cc29" label="text-like">Mass. Dilexisti. p. 1225, except:</l><l xml:id="m-63a7b6ba-4e5f-4d24-804f-162cfe785c65" facs="#m-fa07ebbf-0241-4dc0-82dd-114188f2af56" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-57d079e2-fd21-4253-ad81-418752e6f729" facs="#m-a47666d1-63fe-4485-8257-9dab8e24eb2f" label="lyrics-like">Eus, humflium celsitúdo, qui! mus; ita nos humilitátis ejus ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-e436c399-3093-4324-9e20-0a9d5890597a" facs="#m-73aef1cf-868a-4f63-a0a8-66c745a92c9c" label="lyrics-like">I beátam Virginem Juliánam stigia sectári in terris, "ut cum</l><l xml:id="m-06718230-1a71-4015-a411-843628eb4880" facs="#m-1d398a05-9f31-435a-b8b2-c007ff5e1a67" label="lyrics-like">adpromovéndum sanctissimi l ipsa sublimári mereámur in cae¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fed9ec4-84d8-48a0-a174-431ce159dbdc" facs="#m-a9c520f7-ff83-426e-8217-31818837a1ed" label="lyrics-like">Sacraménti cultum mirabiliter] lis. Per Dóminum nostrum Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-83b18afa-e834-4c80-b9e5-d79be24f5485" facs="#m-85ee1ffd-d3d9-4415-8070-96f5e1512b92" label="lyrics-like">inflammásti:t tribue, quaésu- sum Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-e37be8bd-dac5-4414-86a1-4217a78db657" facs="#m-2848626e-6857-4a7b-b9f9-9a895002648b" label="ambiguous">APRIL 26</l><l xml:id="m-a9ca6d38-99ae-44f7-bccd-4b7bd6ce7f0a" facs="#m-397c02af-bc01-46ab-ad64-1dcfee77cb18" label="text-like">Our Lady of Good Counsel</l><l xml:id="m-1e3572b1-dddb-4a20-b97f-2fd17680ebc2" facs="#m-e472db05-df25-4206-bbec-d53b2d97f5ec" label="ambiguous">II class</l><l xml:id="m-cd2bb1e1-61ff-48e8-97c4-983a3edd4d46" facs="#m-15e620e9-554d-4291-849f-782c6e4cd527" label="text-like">In the diocese of Brooklyn</l><l xml:id="m-876d7713-e03e-4c2d-9505-c2600bb4e2de" facs="#m-e43dcabe-4521-4e1c-a290-6a61ae10bea9" label="text-like">AT MASS</l><l xml:id="m-982e1b6c-ef13-4cea-b20f-80e45980a155" facs="#m-3db2f696-a157-47d9-b633-27f6887c5db2" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-276d03ca-edeb-485d-bb44-c312070de24e" facs="#m-ee6fcd64-3f80-41d7-af68-b46a87e33c1d" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-97ff5e22-149d-4e11-a220-9a291484a658" facs="#m-a934f34d-a8ef-405d-aa51-bb2de396a279" label="ambiguous">G</l><l xml:id="m-2c8bd40a-d60b-43bc-93f9-36a0362abb0f" facs="#m-6880edf1-3ad6-46f1-9be4-99d0f0ce4cfe" label="lyrics-like">Aude-ámus“ ómnes in Dó- mi- no, di-em fé¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
